            <div class="quality-bar-track">
              <div class="quality-bar-fill rich"><span class="quality-bar-val">10+ yrs</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:9px; color:#4a7a50;">
          Children in the poorest nations receive less than <strong style="color:#e74c3c;">⅓</strong> the quality schooling of peers in wealthy countries.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Gender gap -->
      <div class="gender-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
        <div class="gender-label">Closing the Gender Gap</div>
        <div class="gender-title">Gender Enrollment Status by Education Level (2023)</div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:16px;">
